{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkcjuTfDnvETpY6fqV9G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with Pesagot as the account and the IBI ת\"א-125 tracker fund, \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\". By the page's sums I'd end up with about **86,045 ₪** after 10 years. That's not for my own amounts though. It's for the page's example of 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month, which is 70,000 ₪ put in. It's after fees and tax, in today's money, and it assumes 7% a year. I'm fairly sure. What decided it was that the page itself says \"הכי הרבה בכל המחירונים: 86,045 ₪, אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A), פסגות\", and that same pair is starred \"הזול\" at the top.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **First screen:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" was exactly what I wanted. ת\"א-125 was already picked. The amounts showed 10,000 ₪ and 500 ₪, not my 30,000. These are only screenshots, so I couldn't move the sliders, and I went with the page's numbers.\n- **Result box:** \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\", then Pesagot, \"הזול\", 86,045 ₪. Next to it was another pair at 85,015 ₪, \"−1.2%\". That 86k is the number that stuck.\n- **Fee bar and legend:** I glanced at it. \"דמי משמרת\" and \"העמלות זו על זו\" mean nothing to me.\n- **List of accounts:** Pesagot first at 1,049 ₪ in costs. Leumi is second at 82,968 ₪, with 4,506 ₪ in costs. Leumi is a name I trust more, but 3,000 ₪ less is real money. Pesagot I've at least heard of. The bottom ones, אלטשולר טרייד, אקסלנס and מיטב טרייד, are around 63–65k with big red bars, so no way.\n- **Fund card:** \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\" sounds like nothing. I skipped \"נאמן 0.025%\".\n- **List of funds:** every one has a minus, from \"−0.04%\" up to \"−0.54%\", and \"−1,030 ₪\" and so on. That freaked me out a bit until I saw that the one I picked had the smallest minus.\n- **Further down:** I skimmed the \"what changes it most\" chart and saw \"שנים\" with \"18,905 ₪ יותר\". The steps chart and the line \"הכי הרבה...\" confirmed my pick, so I stopped there.\n\n**What I skipped:** the long grey explanation above the account list, the \"לא בחישוב\" notes and the folds under them, the note under the fund list (\"מול המדד...\"), and screens 12–13.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** דמי משמרת, נאמן, העמלות זו על זו, \"(4A)\", מחקה versus סל (aren't they the same?), \"קבועים / משתנים\", \"−0.04% בשנה · שנה אחת\", \"נשען על כלל מס פתוח: מוצג ולא מדורג\".\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- The minus signs on every fund look like losses.\n- The example amounts don't match mine, and that's easy to miss.\n- I'd tell you up front how you actually open an account at Pesagot.\n- Three legends in different colours is too much."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3701,"cache_read_input_tokens":21038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3701},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70eb915b-4184-4b5a-ae32-0e72a0abcf5d","uuid":"f126235c-953b-4f3e-a783-72d923089a46","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:04:19.293Z","request_id":"req_011CgkcjtWcBSy3dU5g4yNme"}
